{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "どうも！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46   二期生   宮崎県出身\nまつりちゃんこと松田里奈です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログ開いていただきありがとうございます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先日YouTubeに公開された、宮崎ロケの企画ですが、より多くの方に親しんでいただけるよう、タイトルを『わたしの、推し👍みやざき旅』にリニューアルしました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "他の大使の皆様の推し飯・スポットも合わせて、「みやざき観光ナビ」で公開予定です！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/iU9xT7LyYDM?si=EL7iblU_w9nP_SBC"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひご覧ください！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まだ載せれてなかったオフショット📸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobnPV0mF.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mob5Lq7Te.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobcf8xkQ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "プリントシール機発見！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mob1lD8dd.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobj14VTp.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type":